{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114180320591-1114_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261114151742\"/><p>萊肯希思皇家空軍基地有美軍駐紮。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>美軍駐紮的英國東部薩福克郡萊肯希思皇家空軍基地周五（13日）出現可疑無人機活動，基地人員一度收到就地避險指令。</p><p>美國空軍發言人證實事件，沒有人員、飛機或基礎設施受影響。英國國防部表示，相關情況已解決，正與美軍合作查明事件。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:23:25.788262+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:03:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:20:37.227424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:16:53.108283+00:00","content_hash":"576c1f03d2b2a9f81648812721f777c06ce0d9471564e7b8ea0b631a9c00ca7d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}